          "Monitor younger adult (under 40) economic satisfaction and Republican retention — at 37.8 median age with 22.2% college attainment and $59,116 income, this is a constituency evaluating on whether government is delivering economic mobility, not inherited partisan loyalty; generational erosion is a slower process but shifts the seat's underlying competitive environment."
