          "Engage the Black community directly on healthcare access and economic opportunity rather than defaulting to assumptions about Democratic base voters — a Republican who demonstrates genuine understanding of healthcare disparities and takes them seriously can at minimum reduce opposition turnout and persuade marginal voters; a Democrat must consolidate this community's participation while not losing working-class white and Hispanic voters to economic messaging from the Republican.",
