          "Address the renter and younger-adult constituency directly on housing affordability and economic mobility; the 19.6% renter rate and 40.3% college-educated population signal a constituency that evaluates on concrete economic outcomes, not inherited partisan loyalty, and whose engagement requires specific policy answers.",
