          "Engage the renter and younger adult constituency on housing affordability and economic opportunity; the 26.2% renter rate and 25% Democratic opposition together represent a real constituency whose needs differ from the homeowner majority and whose mobilization around specific grievances is sufficient to narrow a 75% margin in a future cycle.",
